          "text": "ama imbazu ama ma ga adriza onzi amani ani Mungu inzizu kuri pi, u nyakuniri be, ama ma ovu wudrikuru curu’dori ma alia asi e’yeresi, e’yo kililiruri pie, adriza amani ani Mungu inzizuri pie; ",
